{"2845990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Captain Soda Prologue", "steam_appid": 2845990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/1dce74824154b72d24e94a6300436d63.avif?t=1785639627\" width=616 height=387 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This prologue is a small slice of the full game. Wishlist and follow the main game!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROLOGUE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode: 3 levels of varying difficulty with 7 extra challenges and 4 intensity modes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: access the randomly generated rogue-like endless mode up to level 3 and a set of unlockable items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with weapons, accessories and permanent upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 different soda characters for different gameplay options </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Submit your high scores to the prologue endless mode leaderboards </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform into the ultimate pop bottle hero, obliterating an alien army with your sparkling soda guns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain Soda takes arcade shoot'em up platforming to new heights, boasting soda flavors with unique abilities, flashy weapons, powerful upgrades, and pulse-pounding challenges. Revel in the fluid controls that let you jiggle, slosh, and clink with satisfaction as you annihilate enemies and navigate the chaos.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw-down wave after wave of money-abducting alien invaders with weapons like the Bubble Sub-machine Gun and Bottle Rocket Launcher. Pick your favorite carbonated beverage and shoot water guns loaded with it, all while grooving to an Arcade Orchestral synth soundtrack composed by Aleix Ramon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/6cd6d4217fa0983f27a5e5618227ddef.poster.avif?t=1785639627\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/6cd6d4217fa0983f27a5e5618227ddef.webm?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/6cd6d4217fa0983f27a5e5618227ddef.mp4?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SATISFY YOUR THIRST FOR VIOLENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the alien invaders with a variety of short-range, long-range and melee weapons. Toss exploding cans, fly with a soda-powered jetpack, or flatten them with an entire vending machine! Hone your skills to evade and defeat 18 different types of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a331c1f533c7ac99940df28cc95a5cf2.poster.avif?t=1785639627\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a331c1f533c7ac99940df28cc95a5cf2.webm?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a331c1f533c7ac99940df28cc95a5cf2.mp4?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIX, MATCH AND UPGRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as different soda heroes to dazzle the enemy like Lieutenant Lemonade or Major Matcha Bubble Tea. Acquire over 14 accessories and upgrades like the CO2 Boost Boots and Effervescent Wings to tailor to your play style and boost your power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a3c5f3a848217ab9a032089aa06fa594.poster.avif?t=1785639627\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a3c5f3a848217ab9a032089aa06fa594.webm?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/a3c5f3a848217ab9a032089aa06fa594.mp4?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTENSE HEART-RACING CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and blast your way through a vibrant campaign across three mysterious areas with diverse carbonated themes. Complete over 60 optional missions, unlock item shops, and uncover secret upgrades as you pursue the enemy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/ea6f8e1d69b2903236d8f2af72020320.poster.avif?t=1785639627\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/ea6f8e1d69b2903236d8f2af72020320.webm?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845990/extras/ea6f8e1d69b2903236d8f2af72020320.mp4?t=1785639627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEVER-ENDING ENDLESS MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight never-ending waves of enemies in rogue-like Endless mode, where each level is more intense than the last one! 